{"2670430":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Dashoot: ABYA's Adventure","steam_appid":2670430,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with one hand. Aim with the other. Dashoot: ABYA's Adventure is a hardcore precision platformer that puts both to work: shoot mechanisms and move platforms with your floating cannon, then collect ability items to dash. Limited charges and different launch directions challenge you to connect each shot, jump, and landing into a route through the ruins. And after waking up underground, you have another question to answer: why are you a robot?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a team bringing together a level designer and veteran Celeste player, a former miHoYo worldbuilding designer, and a former Sunborn technical-audio creator.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/69926098d2c96cdea8869ad6511256af.avif?t=1795665186\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras_big\/69926098d2c96cdea8869ad6511256af.webp?t=1795665186 width=1560 height=240 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Control ABYA and the floating cannon independently, combining movement, aiming, and mechanisms.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Collect different items to chain dashes, launch along the line to a device, or dash backwards over long distances. Plan around their charges, directions, and landing points.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Turn a first clear into a faster route, experimenting with shortcuts and ways to skip past obstacles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cross a nuclear plant and a geothermal station, discovering subway stops, Chinese signs, and clues in a pixel-art underground world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Follow AI Deus and a trail of banter and dialogue to uncover who you are and why you became a robot.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/ed78824c32491fee15e76c90c511f826.avif?t=1795665186\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras_big\/ed78824c32491fee15e76c90c511f826.webp?t=1795665186 width=1560 height=240 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the jump itself: judge the gaps, avoid hazards, and time each takeoff and landing. Compact stages make every move count. Retry from checkpoints and turn a difficult stretch into a route you know by heart.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/dcfbf9285fa841090eb83f5231c5e7c7.poster.avif?t=1795665186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/dcfbf9285fa841090eb83f5231c5e7c7.webm?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/dcfbf9285fa841090eb83f5231c5e7c7.mp4?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/165e07ab7bbff6b4d8fb57a4a37a9ac8.avif?t=1795665186\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras_big\/165e07ab7bbff6b4d8fb57a4a37a9ac8.webp?t=1795665186 width=1560 height=240 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot switches and move platforms with your floating cannon, then collect ability items and spend their charges to dash. Each item has its own dash count, direction, and distance. Plan your landing and connect your shots and dashes into a path through the stage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/2419fa9af4e987fed97685603aa62dd7.poster.avif?t=1795665186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/2419fa9af4e987fed97685603aa62dd7.webm?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/2419fa9af4e987fed97685603aa62dd7.mp4?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/1ccde4e6b6589ee5be947acecebc4f78.avif?t=1795665186\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras_big\/1ccde4e6b6589ee5be947acecebc4f78.webp?t=1795665186 width=1560 height=240 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a nuclear plant and a geothermal station, reading the platforms and timing your dashes in each new setting. Different layouts give familiar items new uses as you observe, experiment, and find your way through.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/418c10d9880200c2817462389af464e8.poster.avif?t=1795665186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/418c10d9880200c2817462389af464e8.webm?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/418c10d9880200c2817462389af464e8.mp4?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/57bd2da56d0c172bda9e7940cb5802a9.avif?t=1795665186\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras_big\/57bd2da56d0c172bda9e7940cb5802a9.webp?t=1795665186 width=1560 height=240 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ABYA wakes in the underground ruins to find a world without power and a body made of metal. Follow AI Deus through power stations and subway stops, piecing together banter, dialogue, and scattered records in search of clues to your identity.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/3ad2fbc704c7dc9cfbb10d25d3e3e3a2.poster.avif?t=1795665186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/3ad2fbc704c7dc9cfbb10d25d3e3e3a2.webm?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/3ad2fbc704c7dc9cfbb10d25d3e3e3a2.mp4?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with one hand. Aim with the other. Dashoot: ABYA's Adventure is a hardcore precision platformer that puts both to work: shoot mechanisms and move platforms with your floating cannon, then collect ability items to dash. Limited charges and different launch directions challenge you to connect each shot, jump, and landing into a route through the ruins. And after waking up underground, you have another question to answer: why are you a robot?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a team bringing together a level designer and veteran Celeste player, a former miHoYo worldbuilding designer, and a former Sunborn technical-audio creator.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/69926098d2c96cdea8869ad6511256af.avif?t=1795665186\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras_big\/69926098d2c96cdea8869ad6511256af.webp?t=1795665186 width=1560 height=240 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Control ABYA and the floating cannon independently, combining movement, aiming, and mechanisms.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Collect different items to chain dashes, launch along the line to a device, or dash backwards over long distances. Plan around their charges, directions, and landing points.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Turn a first clear into a faster route, experimenting with shortcuts and ways to skip past obstacles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cross a nuclear plant and a geothermal station, discovering subway stops, Chinese signs, and clues in a pixel-art underground world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Follow AI Deus and a trail of banter and dialogue to uncover who you are and why you became a robot.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/ed78824c32491fee15e76c90c511f826.avif?t=1795665186\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras_big\/ed78824c32491fee15e76c90c511f826.webp?t=1795665186 width=1560 height=240 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the jump itself: judge the gaps, avoid hazards, and time each takeoff and landing. Compact stages make every move count. Retry from checkpoints and turn a difficult stretch into a route you know by heart.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/dcfbf9285fa841090eb83f5231c5e7c7.poster.avif?t=1795665186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/dcfbf9285fa841090eb83f5231c5e7c7.webm?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/dcfbf9285fa841090eb83f5231c5e7c7.mp4?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/165e07ab7bbff6b4d8fb57a4a37a9ac8.avif?t=1795665186\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras_big\/165e07ab7bbff6b4d8fb57a4a37a9ac8.webp?t=1795665186 width=1560 height=240 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot switches and move platforms with your floating cannon, then collect ability items and spend their charges to dash. Each item has its own dash count, direction, and distance. Plan your landing and connect your shots and dashes into a path through the stage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/2419fa9af4e987fed97685603aa62dd7.poster.avif?t=1795665186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/2419fa9af4e987fed97685603aa62dd7.webm?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/2419fa9af4e987fed97685603aa62dd7.mp4?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/1ccde4e6b6589ee5be947acecebc4f78.avif?t=1795665186\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras_big\/1ccde4e6b6589ee5be947acecebc4f78.webp?t=1795665186 width=1560 height=240 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a nuclear plant and a geothermal station, reading the platforms and timing your dashes in each new setting. Different layouts give familiar items new uses as you observe, experiment, and find your way through.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/418c10d9880200c2817462389af464e8.poster.avif?t=1795665186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/418c10d9880200c2817462389af464e8.webm?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/418c10d9880200c2817462389af464e8.mp4?t=1795665186\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras\/57bd2da56d0c172bda9e7940cb5802a9.avif?t=1795665186\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2670430\/extras_big\/57bd2da56d0c172bda9e7940cb5802a9.webp?t=1795665186 width=1560 height=240 \/><\